        "Permission: unclear. You say the page lists the address, but not what it is for. If it says 'customers', a supplier-style message may not fit. Relevance: passes, because the blog date you recorded is a fact about this business. Respect: not yet judged, because there is no message. Plan to make 'no' easy.",
        "Assumptions: that the address is read by a person, and that the blog date is still current. Both are things only you can check.",
